POST    http://localhost:3000/api/quiz/
Authorization:Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
   "title": "Components Lesson Quiz",
  "description": "Test your understanding of the lesson",
  "passMark": 60,
  "timeLimit": 15,
  "maxAttempts": 1,
  "shuffleQuestions": false,
  "shuffleChoices": true,
  "showResultImmediately": true,
  "isPublished": false,
  "courseId": 5,
  "quizTarget":"course"
}
 
### publish the exam (needs at least one question first)
PATCH  http://localhost:3000/api/quiz/5
Authorization: Bearer <instructor token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isPublished": true
}

### get course quizes
Get  http://localhost:3000/api/quiz/courseQuiz/5
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### get ins quizes
Get  http://localhost:3000/api/quiz/insQuizes
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### get quiz details
Get  http://localhost:3000/api/quiz/quiz-details/5
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
